{"id":"1a4afb459225c46e","group":"58","path":"58/batch18/58-df-zfc-largecard4-guessing-model.md","title":"ZFC Largecard4 Guessing Model","display":"df-zfc-largecard4-guessing-model — ZFC Largecard4 Guessing Model","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-largecard4-guessing-model","aliases":["58-df-zfc-largecard4-guessing-model"],"display":"df-zfc-largecard4-guessing-model — ZFC Largecard4 Guessing Model","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-zfc-hereditary-size-class.md]]","[[../batch08/58-df-elementary-substructure.md]]","[[../batch06/58-df-proper.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-largecard4-guessing-model"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-largecard4-guessing-model</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-largecard4-guessing-model — ZFC Largecard4 Guessing Model"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0fbfc19800246e77\" href=\"?note=0fbfc19800246e77\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md\">../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b4c8e863bb75986f\" href=\"?note=b4c8e863bb75986f\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-zfc-hereditary-size-class.md\">../batch14/58-df-zfc-hereditary-size-class.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"faf104362ffe13b3\" href=\"?note=faf104362ffe13b3\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-elementary-substructure.md\">../batch08/58-df-elementary-substructure.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8935dcac821c0104\" href=\"?note=8935dcac821c0104\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-proper.md\">../batch06/58-df-proper.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,\\kappa\\in V\">\\(M,\\kappa\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span> (regular-cardinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0fbfc19800246e77\" href=\"?note=0fbfc19800246e77\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md\">../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{HereditarySizeClass}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{HereditarySizeClass}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (hereditary-size-class predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"b4c8e863bb75986f\" href=\"?note=b4c8e863bb75986f\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-zfc-hereditary-size-class.md\">../batch14/58-df-zfc-hereditary-size-class.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_{\\in}\">\\(\\mathcal L_{\\in}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (pure membership language and its canonical set-coded structures, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"8935dcac821c0104\" href=\"?note=8935dcac821c0104\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-proper.md\">../batch06/58-df-proper.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ElementarySubstructure}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ElementarySubstructure}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (elementary-substructure predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"faf104362ffe13b3\" href=\"?note=faf104362ffe13b3\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-elementary-substructure.md\">../batch08/58-df-elementary-substructure.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcLargecard4GuessingModel}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcLargecard4GuessingModel}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}largecard4\\text{-}guessing\\text{-}model}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcLargecard4GuessingModel}_S(M,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega&lt;\\kappa\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\exists\\theta,H_\\theta,\\mathfrak M,\\mathfrak H\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\theta)\\land\\kappa&lt;\\theta\n\\land\\mathrm{HereditarySizeClass}_S(H_\\theta,\\theta)\\land M\\subseteq H_\\theta\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad{}\\land\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathfrak M,M)\n\\land\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathfrak H,H_\\theta)\n\\land\\mathrm{ElementarySubstructure}_S(\\mathfrak M,\\mathfrak H,\\mathcal L_\\in)\n\\land\\kappa\\in M\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad{}\\land\\forall x\\in M\\;\\forall X\\subseteq x\\;\\Bigl(\n\\forall a\\in M\\;\\bigl(a\\subseteq H_\\theta\\land|a|&lt;\\kappa\\to X\\cap a\\in M\\bigr)\n\\to\\exists Y\\in M\\;\\bigl(Y\\subseteq x\\land X\\cap M=Y\\cap M\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}largecard4\\text{-}guessing\\text{-}model}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcLargecard4GuessingModel}_S(M,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega&lt;\\kappa\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\exists\\theta,H_\\theta,\\mathfrak M,\\mathfrak H\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\theta)\\land\\kappa&lt;\\theta\n\\land\\mathrm{HereditarySizeClass}_S(H_\\theta,\\theta)\\land M\\subseteq H_\\theta\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad{}\\land\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathfrak M,M)\n\\land\\mathrm{MembershipStructure}_S(\\mathfrak H,H_\\theta)\n\\land\\mathrm{ElementarySubstructure}_S(\\mathfrak M,\\mathfrak H,\\mathcal L_\\in)\n\\land\\kappa\\in M\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad{}\\land\\forall x\\in M\\;\\forall X\\subseteq x\\;\\Bigl(\n\\forall a\\in M\\;\\bigl(a\\subseteq H_\\theta\\land|a|&lt;\\kappa\\to X\\cap a\\in M\\bigr)\n\\to\\exists Y\\in M\\;\\bigl(Y\\subseteq x\\land X\\cap M=Y\\cap M\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Both sides of the elementary-substructure claim are now canonical set-coded membership structures in the same pure membership language.</li>\n<li>A <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>-approximated subset of an element of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> need only be matched on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> by a set belonging to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span>; demanding equality with an arbitrary subset of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> is stronger than the guessing-model property.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"0fbfc19800246e77","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch14/58-df-zfc-hereditary-size-class.md","status":"resolved","id":"b4c8e863bb75986f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-zfc-hereditary-size-class.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-elementary-substructure.md","status":"re